-4: four TURN phases starting normal right-facing, rotating chest/head toward camera stepwise until front-facing. col5 independent right-facing encounter punch. col6 standing portrait.\nRow5 col1-4: four DEFEND phases forearms lifted to block chest, absorb hit, return. col5-6 quiet stance variants.\nRow6: six DEATH phases stagger, kneel, fall, ground impact, settle, final horizontal corpse.\nRow7 col1-4: four grounded LAUNCH phases, deep crouch compressing knees, weight driving upward, toes release, initial rising airborne. col5-6 spare grounded stance variants.\nRow8 col1-4: four LANDING phases descending feet extended, feet contact, deep knee impact absorption, regain neutral standing. col5-6 spare grounded stance variants.\n\nAvoid text, grid lines, labels, scenery, tiny body at top, crops, body crossing cells, glossy3D, vector or cartoon. This is actual painted animation art, not duplicate cutouts. Same character/equipment throughout and stronger than reference base.\n",
